        "TileImage": "$($repository 75919b8a-9849-464f-a87d-da4ec40cec5b).Image",
        "Description": "Nov. 20, 2006.\r\rIsola di Haven, Maldive.\r\rCiao, agente 47. Today the next stronzi are Francesco &quot;Frank&quot; Sapienza, Harrold Marinelli, Michele &quot;Mikey&quot; Tripoli, Trevisano &quot;Trey&quot; Pastore &amp; Bradeone &quot;Brad&quot; Mortillaro. 47, there is a guy on Haven Island, who&apos;s name is Carlo Pandolfi. Don&apos;t kill Pandolfi he is the guy who is dancing with his girlfriend. I need you to kill Sapienza, Marinelli, Tripoli, Pastore &amp; Mortillaro. But I need you to not kill Pandolfi, bc I need him alive.\r\rGrazie mille, 47.",
